# Locked UI — do not change unless the user asks

Full list: `docs/locked-ui.md`. Tokens: `docs/design-tokens.md` (Locked shapes).

## SeIconTile stays rounded

`SeIconTile` is `RoundedCornerShape(16.dp)`. `SeGroupIconTile` photos are `RoundedCornerShape(14.dp)`. Do **not** remove those clips or make the tiles square. Keep the Groups home icon skeleton at 16.dp rounded. Avatars stay circular.

```kotlin
// BAD — square
.size(size.dp)
.background(tint.copy(alpha = fillAlpha))

// GOOD
.size(size.dp)
.clip(RoundedCornerShape(16.dp))
.background(tint.copy(alpha = fillAlpha))
```

## Do not revert these either

- Groups home: list skeleton only when `isLoading && allGroups.isEmpty()`; freeze amounts per row, do not hide cached groups.
- Crop dialog: keep title/body, rotate control, `remember(rotationTurns)` for pan/zoom.
- `AppCurrencies.symbol` overrides (AED/SAR/EGP codes; INR/USD/EUR/GBP glyphs) and `MoneyFormat` routing through them.
- Bottom bar fade via `drawBehind` (no extra Scaffold bar height).
